      "side": 1,
      "message": "Now that the UID ranges are in the NetworkCapabilities themselves, can we just entirely get rid of addUidRanges and EVENT_UID_RANGES_ADDED?\n\nOn the producer side, addUidRanges only seems to be called by Vpn.java. We could just replace that with code to set the NetworkCapabilities appropriately, and I think some or all of that is already done in this CL.\n\nOn the consumer side (ConnectivityService), processing UID ranges could simply be done when processing EVENT_NETWORK_CAPABILITIES_CHANGED. For the initial connect, I think we could do it right after we call mNetd.createVirtualNetwork() or mNetd.createPhysicalNetwork().",
      "range": {
